{title: 071 - Come Thou Almighty King}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #071 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 71}
{meta: category Trinity - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Come, Thou almighty [C]King, [F]Help us [C/E]Thy [F]name [C7/G]to sing, Help [F]us [C]to praise!
[F]Father [C]all [C7]glorious, [F]O'er [C]all [F/C]victorious,
[F]Come, [Am]and [C]reign [F]over us, [Bb]Ancient [C7]of [F]Days!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Come, Thou [C]incarnate Word,
[F]Gird on [C]Thy mighty sword,
[F]Our prayer attend;
[F]Come, [C]and [C7]Thy [F]people bless,
[F]And [C]give [C7]Thy [F]Word success;
[F]Spirit of holiness,
[F]On [C]us [F]descend!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]Come, holy [C/E]Comforter,
[F]Thy [Gm/Bb]sacred [F]witness bear,
[F]In this glad [C7]hour:
[F]Thou [C]who [C7]almighty [F]art,
[F]Now [C]rule [F]in every heart,
[F]And [Am]ne'er [F]from us [Bb]depart,
[F]Spirit of [Bb]power!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[F]To Thee, [C]great One [C7/G]in [C]Three,
[F]Eternal [C/E]praises be,
[F]Hence, evermore:
[F]Thy [C]sovereign majesty
[F]May [C]we [C7]in [F]glory see,
[F]And [Am]to [F]eternity
[F]Love [C]and [F]adore!
{end_of_verse}
